@baseUrl = http://localhost/playstation/backend/public/api

### 0. Pastikan Logout dulu untuk uji 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/logout.php

### 1. List tanpa login -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php

### 2. Login sebagai Admin -> 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/login.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

### 3. List setelah login -> 5 pesanan (DEMO0004, DEMO0005, DEMO0001, DEMO0002, DEMO0003)
# Cek DEMO0001: items_count 2, total_cost 51000, status_counts.Rented 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php

### 4. Filter ?status=Overdue -> Hanya DEMO0002
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?status=Overdue

### 5. Filter ?status=Booked -> DEMO0004 dan DEMO0005
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?status=Booked

### 6. Filter ?status=Rented -> Hanya DEMO0001, items_count tetap 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?status=Rented

### 7. Filter ?payment_verified=false -> DEMO0004 dan DEMO0005
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?payment_verified=false

### 8. Filter ?payment_verified=true -> DEMO0001, DEMO0002, DEMO0003
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?payment_verified=true

### 9. Search kode booking: ?search=DEMO0001 -> 1 pesanan (DEMO0001)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?search=DEMO0001

### 10. Search nomor HP: ?search=0812 -> DEMO0001
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?search=0812

### 11. Search nama: ?search=sinta -> DEMO0004 dan DEMO0002
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?search=sinta

### 12. Search karakter wildcard: ?search=% -> Hasil kosong (data: [], total: 0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?search=%25

### 13. Paginasi: ?per_page=2&page=2 -> DEMO0001 dan DEMO0002, meta.total tetap 5
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?per_page=2&page=2

### 14. Validasi gagal (422): status Bogus, page 0, per_page 1000
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?status=Bogus

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?page=0

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/list.php?per_page=1000

### 15. Detail DEMO0001 (booking_id=1) -> 2 item, Budi Santoso, verified_by "Reza Mahardika"
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/detail.php?booking_id=1

### 16. Detail DEMO0003 (booking_id=3) -> Kondisi Good/Good/Slight scratch, deposit returned_at terisi
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/detail.php?booking_id=3

### 17. Detail DEMO0004 (booking_id=4) -> verified_by null, proof_uploaded false
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/detail.php?booking_id=4

### 18. Detail 404: booking_id=999
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/detail.php?booking_id=999

### 19. Detail 422: booking_id=abc, 0, atau kosong
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/detail.php?booking_id=abc

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/detail.php?booking_id=0

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/detail.php